{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/arizeai/jobs/6311447004","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":5104221004,"location":{"name":"Remote (United States)"},"metadata":null,"id":6311447004,"updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:15:03-04:00","requisition_id":"141","title":"Design Engineer, Design Systems","company_name":"Arize AI","first_published":"2026-10-22T09:15:03-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Arize is hiring a Design Engineer to own the Arize design system and the React component library behind Phoenix and the Arize platform. You will work side by side with product designers and turn Figma designs into accessible, fast TypeScript components.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#x27;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve our design system, from tokens in Figma to React components in code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build accessible UI that meets WCAG 2.1 AA across the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve web performance of data-heavy views such as traces and dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we&#x27;re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years building production web apps with React and TypeScript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a design system used by several product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong CSS architecture skills and an eye for detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Location&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is fully remote and open to candidates based in the United States.&lt;/p&gt;
